{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 26,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 616.983,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, these are the words of Ammon to his brethren, which say thus:",
      "verse": "26:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.406,
      "end": 6.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My brothers and my brethren,",
      "verse": "26:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.722,
      "end": 8.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.62,
      "end": 10.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how great reason have we to rejoice;",
      "verse": "26:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.029,
      "end": 19.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for could we have supposed when we started from the land of Zarahemla that God would have granted unto us such great blessings?",
      "verse": "26:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.3,
      "end": 21.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I ask,",
      "verse": "26:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.873,
      "end": 24.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what great blessings has he bestowed upon us?",
      "verse": "26:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.747,
      "end": 25.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Can ye tell?",
      "verse": "26:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 26.495,
      "end": 28.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I answer for you;",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 28.486,
      "end": 34.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for our brethren, the Lamanites, were in darkness, yea, even in the darkest abyss,",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 34.75,
      "end": 37.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, how many of them",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.391,
      "end": 40.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are brought to behold the marvelous light of God!",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.636,
      "end": 43.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is the blessing which hath been bestowed upon us,",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.067,
      "end": 49.175,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we have been made instruments in the hands of God to bring about this great work.",
      "verse": "26:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.855,
      "end": 52.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, thousands of them do rejoice,",
      "verse": "26:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.403,
      "end": 55.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been brought into the fold of God.",
      "verse": "26:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 55.684,
      "end": 58.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the field was ripe, and blessed are ye,",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 58.743,
      "end": 61.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye did thrust in the sickle,",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 61.199,
      "end": 63.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did reap with your might,",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 63.562,
      "end": 65.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all the day long did ye labor;",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 65.785,
      "end": 68.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold the number of your sheaves!",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 68.241,
      "end": 69.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall be gathered",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 70.046,
      "end": 73.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "into the garners, that they are not wasted.",
      "verse": "26:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 73.791,
      "end": 77.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they shall not be beaten down by the storm at the last day;",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 77.593,
      "end": 81.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, neither shall they be harrowed up by the whirlwinds;",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 81.442,
      "end": 85.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but when the storm cometh they shall be gathered together in their place,",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 85.987,
      "end": 88.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the storm cannot penetrate to them;",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.582,
      "end": 91.74,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, neither shall they be driven with fierce winds",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 91.92,
      "end": 94.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whithersoever the enemy listeth to carry them.",
      "verse": "26:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 95.526,
      "end": 98.963,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, they are in the hands of the Lord of the harvest,",
      "verse": "26:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 99.143,
      "end": 100.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are his;",
      "verse": "26:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 100.856,
      "end": 102.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will raise them up at the last day.",
      "verse": "26:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.486,
      "end": 105.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Blessed be the name of our God;",
      "verse": "26:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 105.895,
      "end": 107.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let us sing to his praise,",
      "verse": "26:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 107.933,
      "end": 110.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, let us give thanks to his holy name,",
      "verse": "26:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 110.574,
      "end": 112.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he doth work righteousness forever.",
      "verse": "26:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 113.483,
      "end": 116.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if we had not come up out of the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "26:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 117.053,
      "end": 119.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these our dearly beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "26:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 119.973,
      "end": 122.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have so dearly beloved us,",
      "verse": "26:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 122.661,
      "end": 125.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "would still have been racked with hatred against us,",
      "verse": "26:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 126.045,
      "end": 129.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they would also have been strangers to God.",
      "verse": "26:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 129.929,
      "end": 133.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Ammon had said these words,",
      "verse": "26:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 133.36,
      "end": 135.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his brother Aaron rebuked him, saying:",
      "verse": "26:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 136.094,
      "end": 140.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ammon, I fear that thy joy doth carry thee away unto boasting.",
      "verse": "26:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 140.768,
      "end": 142.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Ammon said unto him:",
      "verse": "26:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 142.759,
      "end": 145.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I do not boast in my own strength",
      "verse": "26:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 145.4,
      "end": 148.837,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor in my own wisdom; but behold, my joy is full,",
      "verse": "26:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 149.017,
      "end": 151.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, my heart is brim with joy,",
      "verse": "26:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 151.612,
      "end": 153.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will rejoice in my God.",
      "verse": "26:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 154.196,
      "end": 156.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I know that I am nothing;",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 156.466,
      "end": 158.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as to my strength I am weak;",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 158.689,
      "end": 161.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I will not boast of myself,",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 161.237,
      "end": 163.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I will boast of my God,",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 163.321,
      "end": 166.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for in his strength I can do all things;",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 166.427,
      "end": 170.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, behold, many mighty miracles we have wrought in this land,",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 171.158,
      "end": 173.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which we will praise his name forever.",
      "verse": "26:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 174.439,
      "end": 178.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, how many thousands of our brethren has he loosed from the pains of hell;",
      "verse": "26:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 178.938,
      "end": 181.492,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are brought to sing redeeming love,",
      "verse": "26:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 181.672,
      "end": 185.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of the power of his word which is in us,",
      "verse": "26:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 185.335,
      "end": 188.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore have we not great reason to rejoice?",
      "verse": "26:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 188.755,
      "end": 191.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, we have reason to praise him forever,",
      "verse": "26:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 191.303,
      "end": 193.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he is the Most High God,",
      "verse": "26:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 193.341,
      "end": 196.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has loosed our brethren from the chains of hell.",
      "verse": "26:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 197.04,
      "end": 201.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they were encircled about with everlasting darkness and destruction;",
      "verse": "26:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 201.771,
      "end": 205.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, he has brought them into his everlasting light,",
      "verse": "26:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 205.713,
      "end": 208.081,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, into everlasting salvation;",
      "verse": "26:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 208.261,
      "end": 212.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are encircled about with the matchless bounty of his love;",
      "verse": "26:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 212.992,
      "end": 217.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we have been instruments in his hands of doing this great and marvelous work.",
      "verse": "26:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 218.641,
      "end": 220.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, let us glory,",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 220.632,
      "end": 222.629,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we will glory in the Lord;",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 222.809,
      "end": 225.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we will rejoice, for our joy is full;",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 225.775,
      "end": 228.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we will praise our God forever.",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 228.277,
      "end": 231.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, who can glory too much in the Lord?",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 231.243,
      "end": 237.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, who can say too much of his great power, and of his mercy, and of his long-suffering towards the children of men?",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 237.925,
      "end": 239.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 239.777,
      "end": 242.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I cannot say the smallest part which I feel.",
      "verse": "26:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 242.918,
      "end": 246.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who could have supposed that our God would have been so merciful",
      "verse": "26:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 247.138,
      "end": 251.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as to have snatched us from our awful, sinful, and polluted state?",
      "verse": "26:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 252.508,
      "end": 257.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we went forth even in wrath, with mighty threatenings to destroy his church.",
      "verse": "26:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 257.971,
      "end": 261.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Oh then, why did he not consign us to an awful destruction,",
      "verse": "26:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 261.68,
      "end": 265.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, why did he not let the sword of his justice fall upon us,",
      "verse": "26:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 265.668,
      "end": 267.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and doom us to eternal despair?",
      "verse": "26:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 268.438,
      "end": 271.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Oh, my soul, almost as it were, fleeth at the thought.",
      "verse": "26:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 271.637,
      "end": 275.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he did not exercise his justice upon us,",
      "verse": "26:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 275.764,
      "end": 278.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in his great mercy hath brought us",
      "verse": "26:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 278.22,
      "end": 283.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "over that everlasting gulf of death and misery, even to the salvation of our souls.",
      "verse": "26:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 284.566,
      "end": 286.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my brethren,",
      "verse": "26:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 286.511,
      "end": 290.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what natural man is there that knoweth these things?",
      "verse": "26:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 290.22,
      "end": 291.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 291.886,
      "end": 294.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there is none that knoweth these things,",
      "verse": "26:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 294.434,
      "end": 296.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be the penitent.",
      "verse": "26:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 296.693,
      "end": 298.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, he that repenteth",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 298.406,
      "end": 300.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and exerciseth faith,",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 300.304,
      "end": 302.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bringeth forth good works,",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 302.76,
      "end": 305.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prayeth continually without ceasing\u2014",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 305.308,
      "end": 308.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto such it is given to know the mysteries of God;",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 309.064,
      "end": 314.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, unto such it shall be given to reveal things which never have been revealed;",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 314.306,
      "end": 319.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and it shall be given unto such to bring thousands of souls to repentance,",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 319.641,
      "end": 324.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as it has been given unto us to bring these our brethren to repentance.",
      "verse": "26:22",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 324.965,
      "end": 327.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now do ye remember, my brethren,",
      "verse": "26:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 327.188,
      "end": 330.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we said unto our brethren in the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "26:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 330.99,
      "end": 335.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we go up to the land of Nephi, to preach unto our brethren, the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "26:23",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 335.721,
      "end": 337.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they laughed us to scorn?",
      "verse": "26:23",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 338.119,
      "end": 339.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they said unto us:",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 339.971,
      "end": 344.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye suppose that ye can bring the Lamanites to the knowledge of the truth?",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 344.702,
      "end": 351.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do ye suppose that ye can convince the Lamanites of the incorrectness of the traditions of their fathers,",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 352.08,
      "end": 354.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as stiffnecked a people as they are;",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 354.768,
      "end": 357.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose hearts delight in the shedding of blood;",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 358.013,
      "end": 361.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose days have been spent in the grossest iniquity;",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 361.769,
      "end": 367.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose ways have been the ways of a transgressor from the beginning?",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 367.475,
      "end": 368.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now my brethren,",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 369.095,
      "end": 371.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye remember that this was their language.",
      "verse": "26:24",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 372.051,
      "end": 373.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover they did say:",
      "verse": "26:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 373.81,
      "end": 376.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Let us take up arms against them,",
      "verse": "26:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 376.266,
      "end": 379.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we destroy them and their iniquity out of the land,",
      "verse": "26:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 380.161,
      "end": 382.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they overrun us and destroy us.",
      "verse": "26:25",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 383.349,
      "end": 387.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my beloved brethren, we came into the wilderness",
      "verse": "26:26",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 387.941,
      "end": 390.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not with the intent to destroy our brethren,",
      "verse": "26:26",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 390.907,
      "end": 395.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but with the intent that perhaps we might save some few of their souls.",
      "verse": "26:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 396.556,
      "end": 398.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when our hearts were depressed,",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 398.826,
      "end": 400.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we were about to turn back,",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 401.142,
      "end": 403.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the Lord comforted us, and said:",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 403.83,
      "end": 406.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go amongst thy brethren, the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 406.471,
      "end": 409.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bear with patience thine afflictions,",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 409.252,
      "end": 411.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will give unto you success.",
      "verse": "26:27",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 412.068,
      "end": 415.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, we have come, and been forth amongst them;",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 415.731,
      "end": 418.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have been patient in our sufferings,",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 418.697,
      "end": 421.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have suffered every privation;",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 421.338,
      "end": 423.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, we have traveled from house to house,",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 424.165,
      "end": 426.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "relying upon the mercies of the world\u2014",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 426.621,
      "end": 431.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not upon the mercies of the world alone but upon the mercies of God.",
      "verse": "26:28",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 432.27,
      "end": 434.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we have entered into their houses",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 434.865,
      "end": 436.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and taught them,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 436.438,
      "end": 438.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have taught them in their streets;",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 439.033,
      "end": 441.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we have taught them upon their hills;",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 441.86,
      "end": 447.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have also entered into their temples and their synagogues and taught them;",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 447.288,
      "end": 449.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have been cast out,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 449.372,
      "end": 450.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and mocked,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 450.574,
      "end": 452.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and spit upon,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 452.194,
      "end": 454.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and smote upon our cheeks;",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 454.232,
      "end": 455.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we have been stoned,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 456.037,
      "end": 457.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and taken",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 457.424,
      "end": 459.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bound with strong cords,",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 459.601,
      "end": 461.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cast into prison;",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 461.406,
      "end": 466.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and through the power and wisdom of God we have been delivered again.",
      "verse": "26:29",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 466.776,
      "end": 469.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we have suffered all manner of afflictions,",
      "verse": "26:30",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 469.975,
      "end": 475.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all this, that perhaps we might be the means of saving some soul;",
      "verse": "26:30",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 475.356,
      "end": 478.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we supposed that our joy would be full",
      "verse": "26:30",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 478.555,
      "end": 481.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if perhaps we could be the means of saving some.",
      "verse": "26:30",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 482.161,
      "end": 487.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, we can look forth and see the fruits of our labors; and are they few?",
      "verse": "26:31",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 487.821,
      "end": 489.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:31",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 489.487,
      "end": 491.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, they are many;",
      "verse": "26:31",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 491.339,
      "end": 498.816,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we can witness of their sincerity, because of their love towards their brethren and also towards us.",
      "verse": "26:31",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 499.496,
      "end": 502.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they had rather sacrifice their lives",
      "verse": "26:32",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 502.834,
      "end": 505.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than even to take the life of their enemy;",
      "verse": "26:32",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 505.522,
      "end": 512.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have buried their weapons of war deep in the earth, because of their love towards their brethren.",
      "verse": "26:32",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 512.75,
      "end": 514.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:33",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 514.973,
      "end": 517.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "has there been so great love in all the land?",
      "verse": "26:33",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 517.939,
      "end": 519.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you, Nay,",
      "verse": "26:33",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 519.977,
      "end": 522.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there has not, even among the Nephites.",
      "verse": "26:33",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 523.583,
      "end": 527.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they would take up arms against their brethren;",
      "verse": "26:34",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 527.339,
      "end": 529.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would not suffer themselves to be slain.",
      "verse": "26:34",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 530.166,
      "end": 533.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold how many of these have laid down their lives;",
      "verse": "26:34",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 534.015,
      "end": 540.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we know that they have gone to their God, because of their love and of their hatred to sin.",
      "verse": "26:34",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 541.243,
      "end": 543.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now have we not reason to rejoice?",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 543.606,
      "end": 545.092,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 545.272,
      "end": 550.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there never were men that had so great reason to rejoice as we, since the world began;",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 550.746,
      "end": 555.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and my joy is carried away, even unto boasting in my God;",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 555.384,
      "end": 559.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has all power, all wisdom, and all understanding;",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 559.233,
      "end": 561.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he comprehendeth all things,",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 561.41,
      "end": 564.661,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he is a merciful Being, even unto salvation,",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 564.841,
      "end": 567.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to those who will repent and believe on his name.",
      "verse": "26:35",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 568.493,
      "end": 571.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now if this is boasting, even so will I boast;",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 571.692,
      "end": 573.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for this is my life and my light,",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 574.148,
      "end": 576.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my joy and my salvation,",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 576.186,
      "end": 578.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my redemption from everlasting wo.",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 578.874,
      "end": 583.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, blessed is the name of my God, who has been mindful of this people,",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 583.698,
      "end": 586.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are a branch of the tree of Israel,",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 586.246,
      "end": 591.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has been lost from its body in a strange land; yea, I say,",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 591.256,
      "end": 597.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "blessed be the name of my God, who has been mindful of us, wanderers in a strange land.",
      "verse": "26:36",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 597.741,
      "end": 601.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now my brethren, we see that God is mindful of every people,",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 601.311,
      "end": 603.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whatsoever land they may be in;",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 603.581,
      "end": 605.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he numbereth his people,",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 605.572,
      "end": 608.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his bowels of mercy are over all the earth.",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 608.771,
      "end": 611.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this is my joy, and my great thanksgiving;",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 611.877,
      "end": 615.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I will give thanks unto my God forever.",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 615.494,
      "end": 616.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "26:37",
      "lineIndex": 190
    }
  ]
}